*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CRD0008
*> PURPOSE : CREDIT APPROVAL RULES
*> AUTHOR  : J.K.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-08-14 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-10-04 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 420
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CRDNIGHT STEP020
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0008.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    05 BKRPT-IND          PIC X.
    *> YEARS SINCE BANKRUPTCY DISCHARGE
    05 BK-YEARS           PIC 9(2).
    *> BUREAU CREDIT SCORE
    05 BUREAU-SCORE       PIC 9(3).
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 APPL-DECISION      PIC X VALUE 'D'.
    *> DECISION REASON CODE
    05 DECLINE-RSN        PIC X(3) VALUE SPACES.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM BANKRUPTCY-CHECK
    DISPLAY "APPL-DECISION=" APPL-DECISION
    DISPLAY "DECLINE-RSN=" DECLINE-RSN
    STOP RUN.
BANKRUPTCY-CHECK.
    IF BKRPT-IND = 'Y'
        EVALUATE TRUE
            *> RECENT BANKRUPTCY DECLINE - LIMIT 7.5 PER 1998 POLICY
            WHEN BK-YEARS < 5
                MOVE 'D' TO APPL-DECISION
                MOVE 'BK1' TO DECLINE-RSN
            WHEN OTHER
                MOVE 'R' TO APPL-DECISION
                MOVE 'BK2' TO DECLINE-RSN
        END-EVALUATE
    END-IF.
